<title>FRANCE: Aerospatiale sees 1996 profit twice H1.</title>
<headline>Aerospatiale sees 1996 profit twice H1.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aerospatiale expects to post a net 1996 profit around twice the 273 million francs it recorded in the first half, chairman Yves Michot said on Monday.</p>
<p>Turnover should be roughly the same as 1995 sales of 49.2 billion francs, &quot;within a few hundred million francs,&quot; he told a news conference.</p>
<p>He said orders exceeded sales at 63 billion francs in 1996, compared with 40 billion in 1995 and 30 billion in 1994.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
